  storyLines:
  - '<wave amplitude=2>Just another day at the bussiness office. '
  - <wave amplitude=2>Only the thought of my sweet little doggy to get me through
    the day. His medical needs - the fuel which powers this vehicle foward in search
    of a paycheck.
  - <wave amplitude=2>The empty frame where his likeness once lit up my cubicle now
    haunts this space.
  - <wave amplitude=2>Why is my sweet doggy's picture gone?
  fadeSpeed: 0.5
